V2.2.0 : [V20200] by Calamath
- Reconverted bundled fonts by the font importer compatible with Slug Library V7.4.
- Updated API version to 101046 (ESO 11.0.x : Seasons of the Worm Cult Part 1)

V2.1.1 : [V20101] by Calamath
- Reconverted bundled fonts by the font importer compatible with Slug Library V7.2.
- Updated API version to 101043 (ESO 10.1.x : Update 43)

V2.1.0 : [V20100] by Calamath
- Changed bundled fonts to Slug font format.
- Updated API version to 101042 (ESO 10.0.x : Gold Road)

V2.0.0 : [V20000] by Calamath
- Refactored the add-on framework based on our common template classes, to reduce future maintenance costs.
- Dropped support for the obsolete LibCFontManager add-on.
- Updated API version to 101038 (ESO 9.0.x : Necrom)


